<section class="section"><div class="container legal"><h2>Website information</h2><p>This website introduces the services and supplied work records of M.M. Construction & Consults. Service descriptions are general information and do not replace an assessment of an individual building.</p><h2>Assessment and scope</h2><p>Suitable tests, repairs, materials, and execution methods depend on the building, available information, site access, and the concern being investigated. A reading or photograph alone does not establish structural safety.</p><h2>Enquiries and quotations</h2><p>Making an enquiry does not create a service contract or confirm project acceptance, price, schedule, or scope. Project-specific terms must be agreed with the company before work begins. A quotation may depend on a site review and supporting information.</p><h2>Project photographs and videos</h2><p>The project gallery uses media supplied by the company. Descriptions are limited to the available work record. Unverified client names, locations, dates, statistics, and structural outcomes are not published.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>The enquiry form prepares a WhatsApp message. You must send it within WhatsApp to deliver the enquiry. Use of WhatsApp, Instagram, and Facebook is subject to those providers’ terms and availability.</p><h2>Website media and content</h2><p>Please contact the company before reusing supplied project photographs, videos, branding, or other website material.</p><h2>Get in touch</h2><p>For a question about the website or a potential project, use the telephone numbers or enquiry options on our <a href="/contact" class="text-link">contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
